{"id":43977,"date":"2025-08-09T15:51:59","date_gmt":"2025-08-09T14:51:59","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=43977"},"modified":"2026-08-23T23:52:59","modified_gmt":"2026-08-23T22:52:59","slug":"trail-da-empada-2025","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-da-empada-2025\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail da Empada 2025"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">O Trail da Empada \u00e9 uma prova de Trail Running, corrida pedestre em Natureza, com duas dist\u00e2ncias, Trail<br>Curto (TC) 18km, Trail Sprint (TS) 12km, e Caminhada 8 Km.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><br>A prova ter\u00e1 in\u00edcio e fim no Arraiolos Multiusos, percorrendo trilhos, estrad\u00f5es, caminhos florestais,<br>singletracks, passagem por ribeiros e locais com interesse hist\u00f3rico. O evento visa a promo\u00e7\u00e3o e divulga\u00e7\u00e3o<br>tur\u00edstica e ambiental da regi\u00e3o e a promo\u00e7\u00e3o do desporto em meio natural. A prova decorre<br>maioritariamente em meio rural, por caminhos e trilhos de terra batida.<\/p>\n\n\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":43978,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497,498],"event_type_2":[728,132],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-43977","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-arraiolos-evora","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-trail-longo","event_type_2-algarve-e-sul","event_type_2-evora"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/2025-07-31_21-42-11_688bd523102e9-1.jpg","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/a